ull},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:13:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:13:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122599","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122599.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122599.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Follow-up to #119150\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nDespite prek supporting `.pre-commit-config.yaml`, an inherent limitation of that file format is frequent version conflicts, particularly for forked branches. While #92204 tried to work around this, and it indeed functioned as a temporary solution, this caused blindspots like #121986 to crop up and have to be dealt with down the road.\r\n\r\nI believe the easiest way to deal with this is to migrate to the prek-native system: `prek.toml`. The way elements are encapsulated in a toml format is far less ambiguous than yaml, meaning that downstream diff tools won't throw a fit if hooks are shuffled around. Now if a specific downstream wants to exclude a given platform from the header hook, they can simply add a new array element!\r\n\r\nThat array element is only possible with the new syntax and logic provided by prek, allowing for collections of globs instead of a multi-line regex. The latter was awful for version control & error-prone whenever tweaks were made; lists of glob patterns dodge that issue entirely.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTechnically one could also simply add prek-style syntax to the existing yaml file, but a lot of the new syntax is very, very ugly in yaml. It also doesn't fully address the whole downstream conflict issues, so I didn't pursue it. `prek.toml` doesn't add any extra clutter, as it's simply replacing one root file with another.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122599/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122599/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}